# Ignore files that shouldn't be sent to Docker build context
# This improves build performance by reducing context size

# Version control
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# Build outputs
**/bin
**/obj
**/out
**/publish

# IDE and editor files
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Test results and coverage
**/TestResults
**/coveragereport
**/coverage

# Node modules (if any frontend tooling)
**/node_modules

# Logs
**/logs
**/*.log

# Documentation (not needed in container build)
**/*.md
!README.md

# Docker files in subdirectories
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/.dockerignore

